WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.336 --> 00:00:15.760
A whole week went by.

2
00:00:17.321 --> 00:00:20.102
Vinnie and Mandy could not go to the attic.

3
00:00:21.363 --> 00:00:24.385
Mom and Dad kept them busy all the time.

4
00:00:26.006 --> 00:00:29.568
On Saturday morning, Vinnie and Mandy got their chance.

5
00:00:31.332 --> 00:00:32.933
Vinnie woke his sister up.

6
00:00:34.313 --> 00:00:35.473
It was still dark.

7
00:00:38.054 --> 00:00:39.814
“What time is it?”

8
00:00:40.555 --> 00:00:42.655
Mandy asked, rubbing her eyes.

9
00:00:42.675 --> 00:00:44.956
“It doesn’t matter.

10
00:00:45.196 --> 00:00:47.336
Come on,” Vinnie whispered.

11
00:00:48.357 --> 00:00:50.437
The children crept up the stairs.

12
00:00:52.338 --> 00:00:54.378
Mandy opened the photo album.

13
00:00:55.239 --> 00:00:58.539
“Look at the Aztec photo,” she said.

14
00:00:59.800 --> 00:01:00.540
Vinnie looked.

15
00:01:01.184 --> 00:01:02.525
“Yeah, that’s us!”

16
00:01:03.126 --> 00:01:03.646
he said.

17
00:01:05.047 --> 00:01:08.190
He shivered as he remembered their Aztec travels.

18
00:01:08.210 --> 00:01:11.112
“Where will we go next?”

19
00:01:11.813 --> 00:01:12.874
he wondered aloud.

20
00:01:15.736 --> 00:01:17.218
Mandy turned the page.

21
00:01:18.879 --> 00:01:23.543
This time the old man stood in front of a very long ship.

22
00:01:24.884 --> 00:01:26.726
The ship had a huge sail.

23
00:01:28.047 --> 00:01:29.248
It glowed brightly.

24
00:01:30.556 --> 00:01:34.740
Along the side of the ship were 16 large round plates.

25
00:01:36.342 --> 00:01:37.703
They were glowing too.

26
00:01:41.366 --> 00:01:42.027
is this?”

27
00:01:42.928 --> 00:01:44.610
Vinnie pulled the picture out.

28
00:01:45.711 --> 00:01:47.692
He stared at the glowing photo.

29
00:01:47.712 --> 00:01:51.556
“It looks like Mandy began.

30
00:01:52.417 --> 00:01:54.119
She couldn’t finish her sentence.

31
00:01:58.280 --> 00:02:00.621
The children fell into the dark tunnel.

32
00:02:00.641 --> 00:02:07.663
“Ow!” grunted Vinnie as he landed on a wooden floor.

33
00:02:07.683 --> 00:02:10.784
“Ugh!” groaned Mandy.

34
00:02:10.804 --> 00:02:12.684
“That hurt.

35
00:02:13.444 --> 00:02:14.745
Where are we?”

36
00:02:16.205 --> 00:02:18.486
The children sat up and looked around.

37
00:02:19.586 --> 00:02:21.927
They were surrounded by wooden chests.

38
00:02:24.067 --> 00:02:26.328
A chilly breeze brushed their faces.

39
00:02:28.080 --> 00:02:29.521
They were rocking gently.

40
00:02:29.541 --> 00:02:34.904
“I think we’re on a ship,” whispered Vinnie.

41
00:02:35.804 --> 00:02:38.146
The ship suddenly moved up and down.

42
00:02:39.546 --> 00:02:41.027
Vinnie lost his balance.

43
00:02:41.047 --> 00:02:43.789
“Whoa!” he cried.

44
00:02:44.749 --> 00:02:48.551
He fell backward, flinging his arms wildly.

45
00:02:48.571 --> 00:02:53.754
“Ouch! You hit me,” said a voice.

46
00:02:55.035 --> 00:02:58.220
A boy slowly sat up, rubbing his arm.

47
00:03:00.021 --> 00:03:02.542
Startled, the children stared at him.

48
00:03:03.702 --> 00:03:06.383
The boy’s fair hair and skin were dirty.

49
00:03:07.383 --> 00:03:12.024
He wore a pair of dark pants, fur boots, and a wool cloak.

50
00:03:14.565 --> 00:03:16.045
“Where did you come from?”

51
00:03:16.606 --> 00:03:17.486
the boy asked.

52
00:03:17.506 --> 00:03:21.627
“We Vinnie struggled to answer.

53
00:03:22.747 --> 00:03:24.768
Mandy got up and looked around.

54
00:03:26.320 --> 00:03:28.261
They were on a large open boat.

55
00:03:29.863 --> 00:03:34.005
There were many wooden benches along both sides of the ship.

56
00:03:36.047 --> 00:03:39.529
About ten men were rowing gently with big oars.

57
00:03:41.050 --> 00:03:44.812
Other men were sleeping on the benches, snoring loudly.

58
00:03:46.333 --> 00:03:50.396
One very large man was snoring louder than all of them.

59
00:03:50.416 --> 00:03:53.918
“Hey—you’re a girl!”

60
00:03:54.679 --> 00:03:57.681
the boy suddenly said, staring at Mandy.

61
00:03:57.701 --> 00:03:59.922
“So what?”

62
00:04:00.583 --> 00:04:02.144
Mandy replied loudly.

63
00:04:02.164 --> 00:04:06.026
“Shh, be quiet,” said the boy.

64
00:04:06.046 --> 00:04:08.027
“You’ll wake him up.”

65
00:04:08.327 --> 00:04:13.350
“Who?” asked Mandy, turning quickly.

66
00:04:14.491 --> 00:04:17.233
As she turned, she knocked over a bag.

67
00:04:18.674 --> 00:04:22.156
It was on top of a barrel and full of iron nails.

68
00:04:23.180 --> 00:04:26.704
The nails scattered loudly all over the wooden deck.

69
00:04:26.724 --> 00:04:32.769
“Him?” Vinnie asked, pointing to the large man.

70
00:04:32.789 --> 00:04:36.132
“Uh-oh, too late.

71
00:04:36.453 --> 00:04:37.754
He’s already awake.”

72
00:04:39.195 --> 00:04:42.298
The man stood up and pulled out a long sword.

73
00:04:42.318 --> 00:04:47.122
“Who dares to board the Sleeping Dragon?”

74
00:04:47.743 --> 00:04:48.464
he growled.
